OL,3,GNEWSABollards and new toilets planned
OL,4,Afor troubled park
OL,5,
OL,6,FBollards and new toilets are planned
OL,7,Ffor a troubled park dubbed a "no-go
OL,8,Fzone" by politicians and residents.
OL,10,FThere had been "countless" reports of
OL,11,Fanti-social behaviour in Rossmere Park,
OL,12,FHartlepool, according to local
OL,13,Fcouncillor Tom Feeney. However,
OL,14,FHartlepool Community Safety Team said
OL,15,Fit had received "limited" information
OL,16,Fabout issues and asked people to report
OL,17,Fincidents.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
