OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABollards and new toilets planned
OL,4,Afor troubled park
OL,5,
OL,6,FHartlepool Borough Council has
OL,7,Fallocated government funding for
OL,8,Fimprovements, including bollards near
OL,9,Fto the car park to stop unauthorised
OL,10,Fvehicles accessing to the main park.
OL,12,FThe local authority said works would
OL,13,Fcost about #50,000 and would begin next
OL,14,Fmonth, with most due to be completed
OL,15,Fbefore April.
